but his plan failed and he was
captured by the Straw Hats.

529
00:35:30,540 --> 00:35:34,897
When their adventure on Fishman Island was
coming to a close, they found it again,

530
00:35:34,980 --> 00:35:36,917
trying to kidnap a group of mermaids.

531
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:39,940
Thanks to Luffy and Peckums,
his plan was foiled.

532
00:35:40,860 --> 00:35:43,120
Later, after reaching the new world,

533
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:46,753
he wormed his way out of one
failed scheme after another.

534
00:35:49,080 --> 00:35:52,477
For a time, it seemed that he
had found a new way of life,

535
00:35:52,560 --> 00:35:54,977
that is, until Drake showed up suddenly!

536
00:35:55,060 --> 00:35:58,337
Promptly defeated him and dragged
him off to the land of Wano.

537
00:35:58,420 --> 00:36:04,297
Now he is forced to work at the excavation
labor camp in Udon alongside Luffy.

538
00:36:04,380 --> 00:36:10,257
Be a pal,

539
00:36:10,340 --> 00:36:13,017
mister—come on, help the needy!

540
00:36:13,100 --> 00:36:13,930
needy

541
