543
00:36:20,500 --> 00:36:21,420
Just go away.

544
00:36:21,580 --> 00:36:23,345
Not even an ounce of sympathy.

545
00:36:23,520 --> 00:36:26,200
We're all cuffed with the C-prism stone.

546
00:36:26,540 --> 00:36:31,246
They're supposed to weaken our power, but
not so much that we're unable to work.

547
00:36:31,740 --> 00:36:34,269
I barely have the
strength to move anymore.

548
00:36:34,640 --> 00:36:36,640
I don't give a crap. Try harder.

549
00:36:37,140 --> 00:36:39,460
Man, why you gotta be like that?

550
00:36:40,200 --> 00:36:41,030
Tell you what.

551
00:36:41,640 --> 00:36:44,257
Give me some dumplings,
and I'll hinge for you.

552
00:36:44,340 --> 00:36:48,100
I've been locked up in this
hellhole for a lot longer than you.

553
00:36:48,460 --> 00:36:50,280
Do you want some insider info?

554
00:36:51,040 --> 00:36:51,870
Huh?

555
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:54,720
So what you say? Sound good?

556
00:36:55,020 --> 00:36:56,780
Just say the word. Ah!

557
00:36:58,700 --> 00:37:00,000
Knock it off!

558
00:37:01,780 --> 00:37:03,880
But I can tell what you're up to.

559
00:37:04,300 --> 00:37:06,957
You want to break out of
here, isn't that right?

560
00:37:07,040 --> 00:37:08,180
Let me help.

561
00:37:08,520 --> 00:37:09,580
Go away!

562
00:37:12,420 --> 00:37:14,880
You better stop slacking up!

563
00:37:17,120 --> 00:37:17,980
That's right.

564
00:37:18,260 --> 00:37:19,848
That guy was really strong.

565
00:37:20,160 --> 00:37:23,120
He overpowered the three of us with ease.

566
00:37:24,100 --> 00:37:26,420
I don't have time for this today.

567
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:30,980
If you'll recall, I was invited
to Shogun Orochi's banquet.

568
00:37:31,620 --> 00:37:32,880
Contact Queen.

569
00:37:33,700 --> 00:37:35,540
Let him take care of it.

570
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:38,240
He can send in some assassins.

571
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:40,417
That would cause an uproar.

